Dashboard Help Badge for Splunk Dashboard Studio

Requires Splunk Enterprise 10.4 or a corresponding Splunk Cloud Platform release.
This app adds four zero-search custom visualization elements:

* dashboard_help_badge.help_tooltip
* dashboard_help_badge.help_badge
* dashboard_help_badge.help_trigger
* dashboard_help_badge.help_panel

Open Dashboard Help Badge - Interactive Tutorial after installation for a guided, editable authoring lab.
Clone the tutorial before editing so the installed answer key remains unchanged.
Use Dashboard Help Badge - Dark Theme to verify the compact trigger and companion panel on a dark canvas.
